{"answer": "1. 计日工表中，综合单价（元）对应的列名为“综合单价（元）（除税价）”。[1]  \n2. 该列位于“实际数量”之后、“合价”之前。[1]  \n3. 表格中“综合单价（元）”为计价核心字段之一。[1]  \n4. 此列由招标人或投标人根据计价规定填写。[1]  \n5. 对应表格编号为表—09—4。[4]", "case_id": "p6s-0001", "question": "计日工表中，综合单价（元）对应的表格列名称是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 23.529337844823317, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "edfff9362c09481ac87016d0", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_7c23d01b896e755bc934", "block_index": 113, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 113, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 41, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第114页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_411e7e16ae329cd8096e", "page_number": 114, "page_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_049fb9b5e6d777669e7b", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_049fb9b5e6d777669e7b", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第114页"], "section_title": "第114页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_7c23d01b896e755bc934"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", "table_parse_status": "skipped"