{"answer": "1. 签证及索赔依据是指经双方认可的签证单和索赔依据的编号。[1]  \n2. 该内容位于“索赔与现场签证计价汇总表”（表—09—5）中。[2]  \n3. 表格中“索赔及签证依据”为必填项，需注明具体文件编号。[1]  \n4. 该表格是维护费用结算的重要组成部分。[3]  \n5. 与现场签证表（表—09—7）及费用索赔申请表（表—09—6）相关联。[2]", "case_id": "p6s-0002", "question": "索赔与现场签证计价汇总表中，签证及索赔依据的描述内容是什么？", "sources": [{"bm25_score": 101.43879802242897, "chunk": {"document_id": "c8588238d99d4079e1ec6101", "id": "488f418f8b31e69fcbd01b90", "metadata": {"block_id": "blk_d81e92e221dd3a4b3e00", "block_index": 114, "block_type": "paragraph", "business_module": "通用知识", "chunk_index": 114, "chunk_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "chunk_parse_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "content_hash": "8ae9b63d869002c1950aaf1192e44b0b876ccb9d927154f35e8c48bcd24094bb", "detected_codes": [], "document_ocr_page_count": 0, "document_ocr_status": "not_required", "document_parse_quality_status": "parsed_with_warning", "document_parse_warning_count": 7, "end_unit": 23, "error_codes": [], "extension": ".pdf", "filename": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "governance_source": "default_curated_policy", "heading_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第115页"], "knowledge_status": "approved", "media_type": "pdf", "next_block_id": "blk_a8730401e7c173672411", "page_number": 115, "page_warning_codes": ["table_like_text_detected", "bordered_table_detected", "semi_structured_table_detected"], "parent_block_id": "blk_411e7e16ae329cd8096e", "parser_name": "pdf", "parser_strategy": "pymupdf_text_with_page_quality_report", "parser_version": "document-parser-v7", "permission_tags": ["public"], "previous_block_id": "blk_411e7e16ae329cd8096e", "review_status": "approved", "section_path": ["电信基础设施维护规程", "第115页"], "section_title": "第115页", "source": "电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_block_ids": ["blk_d81e92e221dd3a4b3e00"], "source_path": "/app/data/电信基础设施维护规程.pdf", "source_type": "manual", "split_index": 0, "start_unit": 0, "table_parse_applied": false, "table_parse_skip_reason": "block_type_is_paragraph", 